# Local dev secrets for `pnpm preview` (wrangler dev).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored).

# Ed25519 signing key set for /.well-known/taistamp. Format:
# one or more `selector:base64-seed` entries, whitespace- or
# punctuation-separated; the last entry signs new responses.
# Selector matches [A-Za-z]([A-Za-z0-9_-]{0,61}[A-Za-z0-9])?;
# seed is 32 bytes encoded as RFC 4648 §4 base64 (e.g.
# `openssl rand -base64 32`).
# Leave empty to serve unsigned TAI64N labels.
TAISTAMP_SECRET=mykey:<output of: openssl rand -base64 32>
